                                "text": "2006 August 28, Louisa Hearn, The Sydney Morning Herald, Tassie YouTube star calls it quits,\nEmmalina, an 18-year-old YouTube hit from Tassie, has bowed out of internet stardom for good after her computer was hacked and her privacy invaded, sparking fears for her own safety."
